# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Series Hub environment
#
# OPTIONAL — live "worldwide trending" shelves with real posters, metadata and
# official trailers (YouTube embeds). Uses the TMDB API (free tier is fine):
#   1. Create an account at https://www.themoviedb.org/signup
#   2. Request an API key (Developer) at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
#   3. Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your key below
#   4. Restart `npm run dev`
#
# This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=
